              "text": "ಹೆಂಡತಿ (heṇḍati) — \"wife\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Built on ಹೆಣ್ಣು (heṇṇu), 'female', with a -ti ending. And heṇṇu carries the sound change you already met in ಹೋಗು: where its sisters keep an old p-, Kannada has h-. So Tamil peṇ, 'woman', and this heṇ- are one word wearing two faces."
            }
          ]
        },
